's attempt to compute using some known combinatorial values? Not straightforward. However, we can try to compute using approximations and modular arithmetic manually? Could attempt to compute using Wilson's theorem and partial products? That would be insane.\n\nInstead, we can try to test our formula against the two expected outputs by using known constraints: The sum S = 314,987,169 (mod mod). Then answer = comb * S mod mod. So answer * inv(S) mod mod = comb. So comb = answer * inv(S) mod mod. So if we compute inv(S) mod mod, we can compute comb for each expected answer and see which yields integer binomial? But we can't compute inv(S) easily without performing modular inverse. But we can compute inverse using extended Euclid manually? Possibly doable.\n\nCompute S mod mod = 314,987,169. Compute its modular inverse mod 1,000,000,007.\n\nWe can try to compute using extended Euclidean algorithm manually? Could be long but possible.\n\nLet's attempt to compute gcd(314,987,169, 1,000,000,007). Since mod is prime, gcd=1. We need x such that 314,987,169 * x ≡ 1 (mod 1,000,000,007). Compute using extended Euclid algorithm.\n\nLet's denote a = 1,000,000,007, b = 314,987,169.\n\nCompute a mod b: 1,000,000,007 / 314,987,169 ≈ 3.174... So 314,987,169*3 = 944,961,507. Subtract: 1,000,000,007 - 944,961,507 = 55,038,500.\n\nSo a = 3*b + 55,038,500.\n\nNow compute b mod r: 314,987,169 / 55,038,500 = 5 * 55,038,500 = 275,192,500. Remainder = 314,987,169 - 275,192,500 = 39,794,669.\n\nNow compute 55,038,500 mod 39,794,669 = 55,038,500 - 39,794,669 = 15,243,831.\n\nNow compute 39,794,669 mod 15,243,831 = 39,794,669 - 2*15,243,831 = 39,794,669 - 30,487,662 = 9,307,007.\n\nNow compute 15,243,831 mod 9,307,007 = 15,243,831 - 1*9,307,007 = 5,936,824.\n\nNow compute 9,307,007 mod 5,936,824 = 9,307,007 - 1*5,936,824 = 3,370,183.\n\nNow compute 5,936,824 mod 3,370,183 = 5,936,824 - 1*3,370,183 = 2,566,641.\n\nNow compute 3,370,183 mod 2,566,641 = 3,370,183 - 1*2,566,641 = 803,542.\n\nNow compute 2,566,641 mod 803,542 = 2,566,641 - 3*803,542 = 2,566,641 - 2,410,626 = 156,015.\n\nNow compute 803,542 mod 156,015 = 803,542 - 5*156,015 = 803,542 - 780,075 = 23,467.\n\nNow compute 156,015 mod 23,467 = 156,015 - 6*23,467 = 156,015 - 140,802 = 15,213.\n\nNow compute 23,467 mod 15,213 = 23,467 - 1*15,213 = 8,254.\n\nNow compute 15,213 mod 8,254 = 15,213 - 1*8,254 = 6,959.\n\nNow compute 8,254 mod 6,959 = 8,254 - 1*6,959 = 1,295.\n\nNow compute 6,959 mod 1,295 = 6,959 - 5*1,295 = 6,959 - 6,475 = 484.\n\nNow compute 1,295 mod 484 = 1,295 - 2*484 = 1,295 - 968 = 327.\n\nNow compute 484 mod 327 = 484 - 1*327 = 157.\n\nNow compute 327 mod 157 = 327 - 2*157 = 327 - 314 = 13.\n\nNow compute 157 mod 13 = 157 - 12*13 = 157 - 156 = 1.\n\nNow compute 13 mod 1 = 0.\n\nSo gcd is 1. Now back substitute to find inverse.\n\nWe need to express 1 as combination of a and b.\n\nWe have the Euclidean steps:\n\n1) a = 1,000,000,007 = 3*b + 55,038,500\n2) b = 314,987,169 = 5*55,038,500 + 39,794,669\n3) 55,038,500 = 1*39,794,669 + 15,243,831\n4) 39,794,669 = 2*15,243,831 + 9,307,007\n5) 15,243,831 = 1*9,307,007 + 5,936,824\n6) 9,307,007 = 1*5,936,824 + 3,370,183\n7) 5,936,824 = 1*3,370,183 + 2,566,641\n8) 3,370,183 = 1*2,566,641 + 803,542\n9) 2,566,641 = 3*803,542 + 156,015\n10) 803,542 = 5*156,015 + 23,467\n11) 156,015 = 6*23,467 + 15,213\n12) 23,467 = 1*15,213 + 8,254\n13) 15,213 = 1*8,254 + 6,959\n14) 8,254 = 1*6,959 + 1,295\n15) 6,959 = 5*1,295 + 484\n16) 1,295 = 2*484 + 327\n17) 484 = 1*327 + 157\n18) 327 = 2*157 + 13\n19) 157 = 12*13 + 1\n20) 13 = 13*1 + 0\n\nNow back substitute:\n\nFrom step 19: 1 = 157 - 12*13.\n\nFrom step 18: 13 = 327 - 2*157.\nPlug in: 1 = 157 - 12*(327 - 2*157) = 157 - 12*327 + 24*157 = 25*157 - 12*327.\n\nNow step 17: 157 = 484 - 1*327.\nPlug: 1 = 25*(484 - 327) - 12*327 = 25*484 - 25*327 - 12*327 = 25*484 - (25+12)*327 = 25*484 - 37*327.\n\nStep 16: 327 = 1,295 - 2*484.\nPlug: 1 = 25*484 - 37*(1,295 - 2*484) = 25*484 - 37*1,295 + 74*484 = (25+74)*484 - 37*1,295 = 99*484 - 37*1,295.\n\nStep 15: 484 = 6,959 - 5*1,295.\nPlug: 1 = 99*(6,959 - 5*1,295) - 37*1,295 = 99*6,959 - 99*5*1,295 - 37*1,295 = 99*6,959 - (99*5+37)*1,295 = 99*6,959 - (495+37)*1,295 = 99*6,959 - 532*1,295.\n\nStep 14: 1,295 = 8,254 - 1*6,959.\nPlug: 1 = 99*6,959 - 532*(8,254 - 6,959) = 99*6,959 - 532*8,254 + 532*6,959 = (99+532)*6,959 - 532*8,254 = 631*6,959 - 532*8,254.\n\nStep 13: 6,959 = 15,213 - 1*8,254.\nPlug: 1 = 631*(15,213 - 8,254) - 532*8,254 = 631*15,213 - 631*8,254 - 532*8,254 = 631*15,213 - (631+532)*8,254 = 631*15,213 - 1,163*8,254.\n\nStep 12: 8,254 = 23,467 - 1*15,213.\nPlug: 1 = 631*15,213 - 1,163*(23,467 - 15,213) = 631*15,213 - 1,163*23,467 + 1,163*15,213 = (631+1,163)*15,213 - 1,163*23,467 = 1,794*15,213 - 1,163*23,467.\n\nStep 11: 15,213 = 156,015 - 6*23,467.\nPlug: 1 = 1,794*(156,015 - 6*23,467) - 1,163*23,467 = 1,794*156,015 - 1,794*6*23,467 - 1,163*23,467 = 1,794*156,015 - (1,794*6 + 1,163)*23,467 = 1,794*156,015 - (10,764 + 1,163)*23,467 = 1,794*156,015 - 11,927*23,467.\n\nStep 10: 23,467 = 803,542 - 5*156,015.\nPlug: 1 = 1,794*156,015 - 11,927*(803,542 - 5*156,015) = 1,794*156,015 - 11,927*803,542 + 11,927*5*156,015 = (1,794 + 11,927*5)*156,015 - 11,927*803,542 = (1,794 + 59,635)*156,015 - 11,927*803,542 = 61,429*156,015 - 11,927*803,542.\n\nStep 9: 156,015 = 2,566,641 - 3*803,542.\nPlug: 1 = 61,429*(2,566,641 - 3*803,542) - 11,927*803,542 = 61,429*2,566,641 - 61,429*3*803,542 - 11,927*803,542 = 61,429*2,566,641 - (61,429*3 + 11,927)*803,542 = 61,429*2,566,641 - (184,287 + 11,927)*803,542 = 61,429*2,566,641 - 196,214*803,542.\n\nStep 8: 803,542 = 3,370,183 - 1*2,566,641.\nPlug: 1 = 61,429*2,566,641 - 196,214*(3,370,183 - 2,566,641) = 61,429*2,566,641 - 196,214*3,370,183 + 196,214*2,566,641 = (61,429 + 196,214)*2,566,641 - 196,214*3,370,183 = 257,643*2,566,641 - 196,214*3,370,183.\n\nStep 7: 2,566,641 = 5,936,824 - 1*3,370,183.\nPlug: 1 = 257,643*(5,936,824 - 3,370,183) - 196,214*3,370,183 = 257,643*5,936,824 - 257,643*3,370,183 - 196,214*3,370,183 = 257,643*5,936,824 - (257,643 + 196,214)*3,370,183 = 257,643*5,936,824 - 453,857*3,370,183.\n\nStep 6: 3,370,183 = 9,307,007 - 1*5,936,824.\nPlug: 1 = 257,643*5,936,824 - 453,857*(9,307,007 - 5,936,824) = 257,643*5,936,824 - 453,857*9,307,007 + 453,857*5,936,824 = (257,643 + 453,857)*5,936,824 - 453,857*9,307,007 = 711,500*5,936,824 - 453,857*9,307,007.\n\nStep 5: 5,936,824 = 15,243,831 - 1*9,307,007.\nPlug: 1 = 711,500*(15,243,831 - 9,307,007) - 453,857*9,307,007 = 711,500*15,243,831 - 711,500*9,307,007 - 453,857*9,307,007 = 711,500*15,243,831 - (711,500 + 453,857)*9,307,007 = 711,500*15,243,831 - 1,165,357*9,307,007.\n\nStep 4: 9,307,007 = 39,794,669 - 2*15,243,831.\nPlug: 1 = 711,500*15,243,831 - 1,165,357*(39,794,669 - 2*15,243,831) = 711,500*15,243,831 - 1,165,357*39,794,669 + 1,165,357*2*15,243,831 = 711,500*15,243,831 + 2*1,165,357*15,243,831 - 1,165,357*39,794,669 = (711,500 + 2,330,714)*15,243,831 - 1,165,357*39,794,669 = 3,042,214*15,243,831 - 1,165,357*39,794,669.\n\nStep 3: 15,243,831 = 55,038,500 - 1*39,794,669.\nPlug: 1 = 3,042,214*(55,038,500 - 39,794,669) - 1,165,357*39,794,669 = 3,042,214*55,038,500 - 3,042,214*39,794,669 - 1,165,357*39,794,669 = 3,042,214*55,038,500 - (3,042,214 + 1,165,357)*39,794,669 = 3,042,214*55,038,500 - 4,207,571*39,794,669.\n\nStep 2: 39,794,669 = 314,987,169 - 5*55,038,500.\nPlug: 1 = 3,042,214*55,038,500 - 4,207,571*(314,987,169 - 5*55,038,500) = 3,042,214*55,038,500 - 4,207,571*314,987,169 + 4,207,571*5*55,038,500 = (3,042,214 + 4,207,571*5)*55,038,500 - 4,207,571*314,987,169 = (3,042,214 + 21,037,855)*55,038,500 - 4,207,571*314,987,169 = 24,080,069*55,038,500 - 4,207,571*314,987,169.\n\nStep 1: 55,038,500 = 1,000,000,007 - 3*314,987,169.\nPlug: 1 = 24,080,069*(1,000,000,007 - 3*314,987,169) - 4,207,571*314,987,169 = 24,080,069*1,000,000,007 - 24,080,069*3*314,987,169 - 4,207,571*314,987,169 = 24,080,069*1,000,000,007 - (24,080,069*3 + 4,207,571)*314,987,169 = 24,080,069*1,000,000,007 - (72,240,207 + 4,207,571)*314,987,169 = 24,080,069*1,000,000,007 - 76,447,778*314,987,169.\n\nThus we have 1 = 24,080,069 * mod - 76,447,778 * 314,987,169.\n\nThus modulo mod, we have -76,447,778 * 314,987,169 ≡ 1 (mod mod). So the inverse of 314,987,169 is -76,447,778 mod mod, which is mod - 76,447,778 = 1,000,000,007 - 76,447,778 = 923,552,229. Check: 314,987,169 * 923,552,229 mod mod = 1? Let's verify approximate: Not verifying now, but likely correct.\n\nThus inv_S = 923,552,229.\n\nNow compute comb = answer * inv_S mod mod.\n\nFirst expected answer candidate1 = 563,321,150.\n\nCompute comb1 = 563,321,150 * 923,552,229 mod mod. Multiply: Let's compute using modular arithmetic manually.\n\nWe can do: (a * b) mod mod.\n\nLet a=563,321,150. b=923,552,229.\n\nCompute product: 563,321,150 * 923,552,229 = ?\n\nWe can break b = 923,552,229 = 923,552,229. Hard to multiply directly but we can compute using splitting.\n\nBetter to compute using 64-bit mental arithmetic? Might be tedious but doable.\n\nLet's try: We'll compute using high precision manual.\n\nLet’s break a = 563,321,150 ≈ 5.633e8, b ≈ 9.2355e8. Their product ≈ 5.2e17. We'll compute exactly.\n\nCompute 563,321,150 * 923,552,229.\n\nWe can use long multiplication: break b into 923 million + 552,229? Actually 923,552,229 = 923,000,000 + 552,229. But also we have to include the remainder.\n\nCompute a * 923,000,000 = 563,321,150 * 923,000,000 = 563,321,150 * 923 * 1,000,000. Compute 563,321,150 * 923.\n\nFirst compute 563,321,150 * 900 = 563,321,150 * 9 * 100 = (5,069,890,350) * 100? Wait 563,321,150 * 9 = 5,069,890,350. Then times 100 = 506,989,035,000.\n\nNow compute 563,321,150 * 20 = 11,266,423,000.\n\nCompute 563,321,150 * 3 = 1,689,963,450.\n\nAdd: 506,989,035,000 + 11,266,423,000 = 518,255,458,000. Add 1,689,963,450 = 519,945,421,450.\n\nThus 563,321,150 * 923 = 519,945,421,450.\n\nNow times 1,000,000 => 519,945,421,450,000,000.\n\nNow compute a * 552,229.\n\nCompute 563,321,150 * 552,229 = 563,321,150 * (552,00